  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Core Types**\n\nI\'m working on the type definitions! I\'m creating interfaces in `src/types.ts` for things like `UserProfile`, `JournalEntry`, `Message` (with roles), `ReflectionSummary`, and `Tag`. The aim is strict typing across frontend and backend for consistency and to improve debugging. I am thinking of using strict typing across the frontend and backend.\n\n\n**Implementing Firebase Integration**\n\nI\'ve got the Firebase integration underway! Initialized the Firebase App, Auth (GoogleAuthProvider), and Firestore. I\'ve also implemented a strict undefined-stripping utility, `cleanPayloadForFirestore`, and prepared Firestore helpers for user-isolated paths. Real-time Firestore subscriptions (`onSnapshot`) and async CRUD functions (`createEntry`, etc.) are being implemented.\n\n\n**Outlining API Endpoints**\n\nI\'m now outlining the API endpoints. Specifically, `POST /api/gemini/chat`, `POST /api/gemini/summarize`, and `POST /api/gemini/brainstorm`. The chat route will handle messages, context, and a system instruction to return a reply and the model used. Summarization will take content and messages to produce a structured summary, and brainstorming will take entry text to generate creative insights. I\'m also planning a health status endpoint. I am working on how Vite middleware will handle development and production.\n\n\n**Designing Entry Workflow**\n\nI\'m now designing the entry workflow. Specifically, I\'m focusing on the active entry studio/workspace. I am thinking through multi-turn conversations, a journal editor, and reflection prompt chips to assist in the writing. The goal is to integrate multi-turn chat message bubbles with markdown support, quick AI tools to automatically summarize, brainstorm and reframe, live save status indicators, and entry metadata. I also want an entry history list and deep AI analysis modal for insights.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 549258759
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
