  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Dashboard Features**\n\nI\'m now focusing on defining the interactive features needed for the `Dashboard.tsx` component. The key functionalities revolve around multi-turn journal entries or reflections. Users will be able to write and converse with Gemini. I\'m considering what kind of helpful responses Gemini should offer to assist users. I am also trying to get a clear picture of the UI elements I will need to build.\n\n\n**Expanding Feature Set**\n\nI\'ve been expanding the feature set for the journal entries. All interactions are being saved to Firestore, ensuring each user\'s data remains private. Users will have the ability to review their entry histories. I\'m building rich mood selectors and reflection starters to encourage journaling. I\'m also planning to implement Markdown rendering for Gemini\'s replies, interactive checklists for action items, and buttons to summarize and brainstorm insights.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 6
      nanos: 527727297
    }
